  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="NL">National appeal &apos;Samen in actie tegen Corona&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In May 2021 the Corona virus is claiming a record number of sick and dead in India and a disaster in Nepal seems equally unavoidable. This is also a concern in countries in Africa and other vulnerable parts of the world.
To save human lives, Giro555 started a National Appeal for speeding up vaccinating worldwide. In addition we support India, Nepal and other countries needing immediate support for their health care and medical assistance for Corona patients.</narrative>
  </description>
